{#
    The tools at the end of a list's tabs, the same three icons in the same order on every list, as
    Shopify Polaris IndexFilters puts its search, filter and sort icons on the row of view tabs and
    Linear its display options at the end of its view bar:
    - Search (`search`), which opens the filter row with its search at the start; only on a list
      that searches;
    - Filter (`list-filter`), which opens the list's filter sheet at once, its green dot saying a
      search or a filter narrows the list (the quick filters stand in the row under the tabs);
    - Display (`sliders-horizontal`), the sheet of the view's quick filters, columns and density.
    Takes:
    - toolsFilter: the id of the list's Ui:FilterBar (collapsible), or null for a list without one;
    - toolsSearch: whether that bar has a search;
    - toolsColumns: {id, action} of the list's Display sheet (Ui:ColumnPicker), its state from
      `picker` and its quick filters from `pinnable` (FilterSheet), or null.
    The names are the partial's own, so a page's `columns` or `filters` never reach it.
#}
{% set filters = toolsFilter ?? null %}
{% set columns = toolsColumns ?? null %}
{% set noJs = '[@media(scripting:none)]:hidden' %}
<div class="flex shrink-0 items-center gap-1 self-center" data-list-tools>
    {% if filters and (toolsSearch ?? false) %}
        <twig:Ui:IconButton icon="search" variant="ghost" size="sm" :label="'ui.filter_bar.toggle_search'|trans"
            aria-controls="{{ filters }}" aria-expanded="false" class="{{ noJs }}" data-controller="filter-toggle" data-action="filter-toggle#search" data-filter-toggle-mode-value="search" data-search-toggle="" />
    {% endif %}
    {% if filters %}
        <span class="relative inline-flex {{ noJs }}">
            <twig:Ui:IconButton icon="list-filter" variant="ghost" size="sm" :label="'ui.filter_bar.toggle'|trans"
                aria-controls="{{ filters }}" aria-haspopup="dialog" data-controller="filter-toggle" data-action="filter-toggle#toggle" data-filter-toggle="" />
            <span class="pointer-events-none absolute right-0.5 top-0.5 size-2 rounded-sm bg-green" aria-hidden="true" hidden data-filter-active></span>
        </span>
    {% endif %}
    {% if columns %}
        {{ component('Ui:ColumnPicker', {id: columns.id, action: columns.action, keep: picker.keep, columns: picker.columns ?? [], density: picker.density ?? null, resetHref: picker.resetHref, modified: picker.modified, quick: pinnable ?? [], presets: manageViews is defined ? (tabs ?? [])|slice(1)|map(t => t.label) : []}) }}
    {% endif %}
</div>
